# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000392> (lattice system value)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000392> "lattice system value"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000392> "lattice system value is a categorical value specification which describes the grouping of
lattice system based on the point group symmetries of their empty translational frameworks. The specific values are triclinic, monoclinic, orthorhombic, tetragonal, rhombohedral, hexagonal, and cubic."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000392> ObjectOneOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000029> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000030> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000031> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000032> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000033> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000034> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000035>))
